<title>JAPAN: Chubu Shiryo - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Chubu Shiryo - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
